DOC|capabilities_index|v1|updated=2026-03-20h

META|purpose=quick lookup index of all registered tools and integrations|inertia=LOW
// This is an INDEX not deep docs. One line per tool. Go to subsystem_*.dsb for detail.
// Update whenever a tool is added or removed. Total count tracked in TOTALS section.

TOTALS|tools=148|integrations=13|env_gates=10|updated=2026-03-20h

SECTION_SYSTEM|
  run_bash|runner.py|run shell commands in workspace (30s timeout)
  run_python|runner.py|execute Python snippets (full OS access, unsandboxed)
  get_current_time|runner.py|current local date+time
  restart_self|runner.py|clean restart with optional wakeup note
  run_benchmark|runner.py|cluster resource comparison benchmarks

