  read_system_file|filesystem.py|read any system file (absolute path, read-only)
  list_system_dir|filesystem.py|list any system directory (absolute path)
  read_pdf_pages|filesystem.py|read PDF by page range with cursor tracking
  check_disk_usage|filesystem.py|free space: ~/.TheIgors + ~/TheIgors + /
  check_resource_load|filesystem.py|CPU/RAM/swap verdict: ok|warn|critical

